    "en": {
      "trackName": "Spider Solitaire - Watch Game",
      "description": "Spider Solitaire is a classic solitaire card game designed for Apple Watch. The rules are easy to understand: arrange cards in descending order from K to A, and complete full same-suit sequences to clear them from the table. With Easy, Medium, and Hard difficulties, you can play a quick round anytime and challenge your observation, planning, and patience.\n\nDifficulty modes:\n1. Easy: Play with 1 suit, ideal for learning the game and finishing quick rounds.\n2. Medium: Play with 2 suits, requiring more careful moves and card organization.\n3. Hard: Play with 4 suits, offering the full Spider Solitaire strategy challenge.",
